    "notes": "The advisory is about esbuild's development server allowing arbitrary file reads on Windows. esbuild is a transitive devDependency here (via tsx and vitest) used only as a build/test transform — its development server is never run, and nothing ships to consumers. Remove this exception once tsx/vite pick up esbuild >=0.28.1."
  }
}
